.H.O. Pandemic Treaty, Dr. Kat Lindley. Dr. Kat will be interviewing several experts about the frightening reality behind the proposed “agreement” and the risks it poses to national sovereignty and healthcare independence.\nAmong several guests Dr. Lindley will sit down with Patrice Pederson, head of the First Freedom Foundation, as well as Dr. Andrea Nazarenko of the Geneva Project.\nThe world is just days away from the W.H.O.’s seventy-seventh World Health Assembly, starting 27 May 2024, at which time Member States will decide the fate of the world’s first pandemic agreement for adoption. Join us Thursday and do you part to #StopTheWho! Show less", "thumbnail": "https://1a-1791.com/video/s8/1/6/n/N/I/6nNIr.qR4e-small-VSRF-Live-127-Special-W.H.O.jpg", "display_id": "v4sqkxb", "fulltitle": "VSRF Live #127: Special W.H.O. Pandemic “Agreement” Update", "duration_string": "1:43:08", "upload_date": "20240515", "release_date": "20240516", "release_year": 2024, "is_live": false, "was_live": true, "epoch": 1777708768, "url": "https://1a-1791.com/video/s8/2/6/n/N/I/6nNIr.aaa.rec.mp4", "format_id": "mp4-1080p-1", "fps": 30, "tbr": 4747, "filesize": 3672813709, "width": 1920, "height": 1080, "protocol": "https", "ext": "mp4", "video_ext": "mp4", "audio_ext": "none", "resolution": "1920x1080", "dynamic_range": "SDR", "aspect_ratio": 1.78, "http_headers": {"User-Agent": "Mozilla/5.0 (Windows NT 10.0; Win64; x64) AppleWebKit/537.36 (KHTML, like Gecko) Chrome/140.0.0.0 Safari/537.36", "Accept": "text/html,application/xhtml+xml,application/xml;q=0.9,*/*;q=0.8", "Accept-Language": "en-us,en;q=0.5", "Sec-Fetch-Mode": "navigate"}, "format": "mp4-1080p-1 - 1920x1080", "_type": "video", "_version": {"version": "2026.01.31", "release_git_head": "9a9a6b6fe44a30458c1754ef064f354f04a84004", "repository": "yt-dlp/yt-dlp"}}